# Cross-repo siblings cloned by setup-dev-env to ../<name>.
#
# The macOS suites compile against both: `nim.cfg` puts `../isonim/src` and
# `../nim-everywhere/src` on the module path (isonim's `isonim/core/platform`
# imports `nim_everywhere/platform`).
#
# The revisions are explicit because `repro.lock` cannot answer for these two:
# `repro.nim` declares no `uses: "isonim"` edge (the Linux build graph reaches
# no sibling), so the committed lock pins this repo only, and a bare name
# would be refused as unpinned. Move a pin by editing the SHA here.
